 your device. It&#039;ll connect automatically, your=0A                         =
                           PC will download the right drivers, and you can =
use it right=0A                                                    away.&lt;/p=
&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A   =
                                                 2. To connect a wireless p=
rinter, download the latest=0A                                             =
       driver and software package for your printer model from=0A          =
                                          the official website and follow t=
hese steps:=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=
=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Star=
t button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                                        =
            Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A            =
                                        scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                    =
